"ctet-q-0190","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t2","","","Which of the following represents the correct ascending order of the rational numbers 3/8, 5/12, and 7/18?","3/8 < 7/18 < 5/12","5/12 < 7/18 < 3/8","7/18 < 3/8 < 5/12","3/8 < 5/12 < 7/18","","A","Converting each fraction to decimal equivalent:
