"ctet-q-0191","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t2","","","Which of the following represents the correct ascending order of the rational numbers 4/7, 5/9, and 6/11?","6/11 < 5/9 < 4/7","4/7 < 5/9 < 6/11","5/9 < 6/11 < 4/7","6/11 < 4/7 < 5/9","","A","Converting each fraction to decimal equivalent:
