"ctet-q-0192","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t2","","","Which of the following represents the correct ascending order of the rational numbers 7/10, 11/15, and 13/20?","13/20 < 7/10 < 11/15","11/15 < 7/10 < 13/20","7/10 < 13/20 < 11/15","13/20 < 11/15 < 7/10","","A","Converting each fraction to decimal equivalent:
