"ctet-q-0196","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t4","","","A principal of ₹15000 is invested at 6% per annum for 2 years. What is the difference between the Compound Interest (compounded annually) and the Simple Interest earned on this amount?","₹54.00","₹104.00","₹29.00","₹81.00","","A","Step 1: Calculate Simple Interest (SI):
