"ctet-q-0197","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t4","","","A principal of ₹20000 is invested at 5% per annum for 3 years. What is the difference between the Compound Interest (compounded annually) and the Simple Interest earned on this amount?","₹152.50","₹202.50","₹127.50","₹228.75","","A","Step 1: Calculate Simple Interest (SI):
