"ctet-q-0198","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t4","","","A principal of ₹16000 is invested at 12.5% per annum for 2 years. What is the difference between the Compound Interest (compounded annually) and the Simple Interest earned on this amount?","₹250.00","₹300.00","₹225.00","₹375.00","","A","Step 1: Calculate Simple Interest (SI):
