"ctet-q-0199","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t4","","","A principal of ₹25000 is invested at 4% per annum for 2 years. What is the difference between the Compound Interest (compounded annually) and the Simple Interest earned on this amount?","₹40.00","₹90.00","₹15.00","₹60.00","","A","Step 1: Calculate Simple Interest (SI):
