"ctet-q-0200","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t4","","","A principal of ₹18000 is invested at 10% per annum for 3 years. What is the difference between the Compound Interest (compounded annually) and the Simple Interest earned on this amount?","₹558.00","₹608.00","₹533.00","₹837.00","","A","Step 1: Calculate Simple Interest (SI):
