"ctet-q-0211","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c3","ctet-math-t14","","","A right circular solid cylinder has base radius r = 7 cm and height h = 10 cm. What is its Curved Surface Area (CSA)? (Take π = 22/7)","440 cm²","748 cm²","1540 cm³","528 cm²","","A","Curved Surface Area of a cylinder is given by the formula:
