"ctet-q-0262","ctet-p2","ctet-math","ctet-math-c1","ctet-math-t2","","","Regarding the core principles of 'Fractions, Decimals & Rational Numbers', which statement provides a scientifically sound and pedagogically verified analysis? (Drill 1)","The observable effects are systematically explained by verified principles of Fractions, Decimals & Rational Numbers.","It contradicts the fundamental conservation laws of physics and chemistry.","It occurs only under isolated artificial conditions and not in real classroom phenomena.","It depends entirely on subjective observer interpretations.","","A","The foundational curriculum for Fractions, Decimals & Rational Numbers in upper primary grades establishes empirical validity through standardized experimentation and conceptual derivation.","","original_practice","Verified Syllabus Practice","Moderate","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
