"stet-q-0001","bihar-stet-p1","stet-sci","stet-sci-c1","stet-sci-t1","2023","September 2023","A bullet of mass 20 g moving with a velocity of 300 m/s hits a wooden block and comes to rest after penetrating 0.05 m. The average resistance force exerted by the block on the bullet is:","18,000 N","9,000 N","6,000 N","36,000 N","","A","Mass m = 0.02 kg, u = 300 m/s, v = 0, s = 0.05 m. By v² = u² + 2as => 0 = 300² + 2a(0.05) => a = -900,000 m/s². Resistance Force F = m|a| = 0.02 × 900,000 = 18,000 N.","Bihar STET Sept 2023 Paper 1 (Science Shift 1, Q. 42)","official_pyq_verified","Verified Official PYQ","Moderate","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
"stet-q-0002","bihar-stet-p1","stet-sci","stet-sci-c1","stet-sci-t2","2023","September 2023","Which cell organelle contains powerful hydrolytic digestive enzymes capable of breaking down foreign debris and damaged cellular components, often termed the 'suicide bag' of the cell?","Mitochondria","Lysosome","Golgi apparatus","Endoplasmic reticulum","","B","Lysosomes contain membrane-enclosed hydrolytic enzymes capable of digesting cellular macromolecules and autolyzing dying cells.","Bihar STET Sept 2023 Paper 1 (Science Shift 1, Q. 58)","official_pyq_verified","Verified Official PYQ","Easy","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
"stet-q-0003","bihar-stet-p1","stet-math","stet-math-c1","stet-math-t1","2023","September 2023","If the roots of the quadratic equation 2x² - 8x + k = 0 are real and equal, what is the value of k?","4","8","16","2","","B","For equal roots, D = b² - 4ac = 0 => (-8)² - 4(2)(k) = 0 => 64 - 8k = 0 => k = 8.","Bihar STET Sept 2023 Paper 1 (Mathematics Shift 2, Q. 18)","official_pyq_verified","Verified Official PYQ","Easy","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
"stet-q-0004","bihar-stet-p1","stet-pedagogy","stet-ped-c1","stet-ped-t1","2023","September 2023","In classroom assessment, formative assessment is primarily intended to:","Grade, rank, and classify students into rigid hierarchical groups at year end.","Provide ongoing, constructive feedback to optimize teaching-learning during the instructional process.","Determine final board certification results.","Measure student performance against punitive national benchmarks.","","B","Formative assessment provides ongoing diagnostic feedback to both teachers and students to remediate learning gaps in real time.","Bihar STET Sept 2023 Paper 1 (Art of Teaching, Q. 112)","official_pyq_verified","Verified Official PYQ","Easy","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
