"stet-q-1080","bihar-stet-p1","stet-sci","stet-sci-c4","stet-sci-t15","","","In biological genetics and ecological systems, what is the value representing 'Phenotypic ratio in Mendel's monohybrid cross in the F₂ generation'? (Variant 1)","3:1","1:2:1","9:3:3:1","10%","","A","Phenotypic ratio in Mendel's monohybrid cross in the F₂ generation is experimentally and classically documented as 3:1.","","original_practice","Verified Syllabus Practice","Moderate","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
"stet-q-1081","bihar-stet-p1","stet-sci","stet-sci-c4","stet-sci-t15","","","In biological genetics and ecological systems, what is the value representing 'Genotypic ratio in Mendel's monohybrid cross in the F₂ generation'? (Variant 2)","1:2:1","9:3:3:1","10%","3:1","","A","Genotypic ratio in Mendel's monohybrid cross in the F₂ generation is experimentally and classically documented as 1:2:1.","","original_practice","Verified Syllabus Practice","Easy","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
