"bpsc-mid-q-0009","bpsc-tre-middle","math","math-middle","math-integrated","2024","TRE 3.0 (July 19, 2024)","The Ministry of Science and Technology recently announced a new set of National Awards in the field of Science, Technology and Innovation known as ‘Rashtriya Vigyan Puraskar’, for which the award ceremony for all categories of awards will be held every year on th","11 May – National Technology Day rd","23 August – National Space Day th","28 February – National Science Day","More than one of the above","None of the above","A","Authentic question from BPSC TRE Middle School (Classes 6-8) Mathematics & Science paper held on 19 July 2024.","BPSC TRE 3.0 Middle School Math-Science Booklet (19-July-2024, Q. 42)","coaching_pyq_unverified","Unverified Coaching PYQ","medium","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
