"bpsc-mid-q-0301","bpsc-tre-middle","bpsc-mid-math","bpsc-mid-math-c1","bpsc-mid-math-t6","","","Person A can complete a piece of work in 11 days, and Person B can complete the same work in 16 days. If both work together, in how many days will the work be completed? (Problem 1)","6.52 days","13.5 days","9 days","More than one of the above","None of the above","A","Let total work = LCM(11, 16) = 176 units.
