• Alkanes (saturated): C_n H_{2n+2} → for n=4: C_4H_10.
• Alkenes (double bond): C_n H_{2n} → C_4H_8.
• Alkynes (triple bond): C_n H_{2n-2} → for n=4: C_4H_6.","","original_practice","Verified Syllabus Practice","Easy","2026-10-13T06:05:20Z"
